-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/25px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/38px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/50px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spectator\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png/25px-Portrait_Spectator.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c7/Portrait_Spectator.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spectator\" title=\"Spectator\">Spectators</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Eyestalk Actions are a special resource, used in lieu of normal actions by Spectators to utilize their <a href=\"/wiki/Beholder_Ray\" title=\"Beholder Ray\">Beholder Ray</a> abilities. Each eyestalk action casts a ray from an eye towards an enemy.\n</p><p>While a spectator can perform two eyestalk actions per turn it cannot use the same ray ability more than once per turn.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Actions_using_Eyestalk_Action\">Actions using Eyestalk Action</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r243549\">.mw-parser-output .defaultleft{text-align:left}.mw-parser-output .defaultcenter{text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .defaultright{text-align:right}.mw-parser-output .col1left td:nth-child(1),.mw-parser-output .col2left td:nth-child(2),.mw-parser-output .col3left td:nth-child(3),.mw-parser-output .col4left td:nth-child(4),.mw-parser-output .col5left td:nth-child(5),.mw-parser-output .col6left td:nth-child(6),.mw-parser-output .col7left td:nth-child(7),.mw-parser-output .col8left td:nth-child(8),.mw-parser-output .col9left td:nth-